States Senate\">United States Senate</a><br/>51<sup about=\"#mwt12\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-2\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"group\":\"lower-alpha\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-2\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-2\" data-mw-group=\"lower-alpha\" id=\"mwEA\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEQ\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEg\">[</span>b<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEw\">]</span></span></a></sup> seats needed for a majority</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:John_Thune_117th_Congress_portrait_cropped.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:John_Thune_117th_Congress_portrait_cropped.jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/John_Thune_117th_Congress_portrait_cropped.jpg/250px-John_Thune_117th_Congress_portrait_cropped.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/John_Thune_117th_Congress_portrait_cropped.jpg/330px-John_Thune_117th_Congress_portrait_cropped.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1945\" data-file-height=\"2593\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"180\" width=\"135\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Chuck_Schumer_official_photo_(3x4a).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Chuck_Schumer_official_photo_(3x4a).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/Chuck_Schumer_official_photo_%283x4a%29.jpg/250px-Chuck_Schumer_official_photo_%283x4a%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/Chuck_Schumer_official_photo_%283x4a%29.jpg/330px-Chuck_Schumer_official_photo_%283x4a%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1766\" data-file-height=\"2354\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"180\" width=\"135\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Leader</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Thune\" title=\"John Thune\">John Thune</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chuck_Schumer\" title=\"Chuck Schumer\">Chuck Schumer</a></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Leader<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span>since</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024_Senate_Republican_Conference_leadership_election\" title=\"2024 Senate Republican Conference leadership election\">January 3, 2025</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">January 3, 2017</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Leader's<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span>seat</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_South_Dakota\" title=\"List of United States senators from South Dakota\">South Dakota</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_New_York\" title=\"List of United States senators from New York\">New York</a></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Current<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span>seats</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">53</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">45<sup about=\"#mwt14\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Independents_3-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Independents\",\"group\":\"lower-alpha\"},\"body\":{\"html\":\"\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Independents-3\" data-mw-group=\"lower-alpha\" id=\"mwFA\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwFQ\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFg\">[</span>c<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFw\">]</span></span></a></sup></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Seats<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span>needed</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\" data-mw='{\"caption\":\"Steady\"}'><span title=\"Steady\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Steady2.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Steady2.svg/20px-Steady2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Steady2.svg/40px-Steady2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" alt=\