mwC8A\">Virginia</a></th>\n<td data-sort-value=\"April 2, 2026\" id=\"mwC8E\">April 2, 2026</td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"August 4, 2026\" id=\"mwC8I\">August 4, 2026</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" data-sort-value=\"November 31, 2026\" id=\"mwC8M\">N/A</td>\n<td id=\"mwC8Q\">7<span class=\"nowrap\" about=\"#mwt2057\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwC8U\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"nbsp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Nbsp\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></span>pm</td></tr>\n<tr id=\"mwC8Y\">\n<th id=\"mwC8c\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_Senate_election_in_West_Virginia\" title=\"2026 United States Senate election in West Virginia\" id=\"mwC8g\">West Virginia</a></th>\n<td data-sort-value=\"January 31, 2026\" id=\"mwC8k\">January 31, 2026</td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"May 12, 2026\" id=\"mwC8o\">May 12, 2026</td>\n<td id=\"mwC8s\">7:30<span class=\"nowrap\" about=\"#mwt2058\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwC8w\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"nbsp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Nbsp\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></span>pm</td></tr>\n<tr id=\"mwC80\">\n<th id=\"mwC84\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_Senate_election_in_Wyoming\" title=\"2026 United States Senate election in Wyoming\" id=\"mwC88\">Wyoming</a></th>\n<td data-sort-value=\"May 29, 2026\" id=\"mwC9A\">May 29, 2026</td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"August 18, 2026\" id=\"mwC9E\">August 18, 2026</td>\n<td id=\"mwC9I\">9<span class=\"nowrap\" about=\"#mwt2059\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwC9M\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"nbsp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Nbsp\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></span>pm</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"17\" id=\"mwC9Q\" aria-labelledby=\"Race_summary\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Race_summary\">Race summary</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=17\" title=\"Edit section: Race summary\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n\n<section data-mw-section-id=\"18\" id=\"mwC9U\" aria-labelledby=\"Special_elections_during_the_preceding_Congress\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Special_elections_during_the_preceding_Congress\">Special elections during the preceding Congress</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=18\" title=\"Edit section: Special elections during the preceding Congress\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p id=\"mwC9Y\">Special U.S. Senate elections in Florida and Ohio are scheduled for November 3, 2026. Florida voters will elect a candidate to serve the remaining two years of former Senator <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marco_Rubio\" title=\"Marco Rubio\" id=\"mwC9c\">Marco Rubio</a>'s unexpired term;<sup about=\"#mwt2062\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-87\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-87\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-87\" id=\"mwC9g\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwC9k\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwC9o\">[</span>64<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwC9s\">]</span></span></a></sup> Rubio resigned his seat in 2025 to become <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_Secretary_of_State\" title=\"United States Secretary of State\" id=\"mwC9w\">United States Secretary of State</a>.<sup about=\"#mwt2065\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-88\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-88\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-88\" id=\"mwC90\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwC94\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwC98\">[</span>65<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwC-A\">]</span></span></a></sup> Ohio voters will elect a candidate to serve the remaining two years of former Senator <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JD_Vance\" title=\"JD Vance\" id=\"mwC-E\">JD Vance</a>'s unexpired term; Vance resigned in 2025 to become <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024_United_States_presidential_election\" title=\"2024 United States presidential election\" id=\"mwC-I\">Vice President of the United States</a>.<sup about=\"#mwt2068\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-89\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-89\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-89\" id=\"mwC-M\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwC-Q\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwC-U\">[</span>66<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwC-Y\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<p id=\"mwC-c\">Elections are sorted by date then state.</p>\n\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" id=\"mwC-g\">\n\n<tbody id=\"mwC-k\"><tr valign=\"bottom\" id=\"mwC-o\">\n<th colspan=\"2\" id=\"mwC-s\">Constituency</th>\n<th colspan=\"3\" id=\"mwC-w\">Incumbent</th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\" id=\"mwC-0\">Status</th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\" class=\"unsortable\" id=\"mwC-4\">Candidates</th></tr>\n\n<tr id=\"mwC-8\">\n<th id=\"mwC_A\">State</th>\n<th id=\"mwC_E\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cook_Partisan_Voting_Index\" title=\"Cook Partisan Voting Index\" id=\"mwC_I\">PVI</a><sup about=\"#mwt2071\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-PVI_42-1\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"PVI\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-PVI-42\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-PVI-42\" id=\"mwC_M\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwC_Q\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwC_U\">[</span>28<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwC_Y\">]</span></span></a></sup></th>\n<th id=\"mwC_c\">Senator</th>\n<th id=\"mwC_g\">Party</th>\n<th id=\"mwC_k\">Electoral history</th></tr>\n\n<tr id=\"mwC_o\">\n<th id=\"mwC_s\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_Senate_special_election_in_Florida\" title=\"2026 United States Senate special election in Florida\" id=\"mwC_w\">Florida</a><br id=\"mwC_0\"/>(Class 3)</th>\n<td style=\"color:black; background-color:#FFB6B6\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" about=\"#mwt2072\" id=\"mwC_4\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[\"| \",{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Shading PVI\",\"href\":\"./Template:Shading_PVI\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"R\"},\"2\":{\"wt\":\"5\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><span data-sort-value=\"105 !\">R+5</span></td>\n<td id=\"mwC_8\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashley_Moody\" title=\"Ashley Moody\" id=\"mwDAA\">Ashley Moody</a></td>\n<td style=\"color:black; background-color:#FFB6B6\" about=\"#mwt2075\" typeof=\"mw:ExpandedAttrs\" id=\"mwDAI\" data-mw='{\"attribs\":[[{\"txt\":\"style\",\"html\":\"&lt;span about=\\\"#mwt2074\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\" id=\\\"mwDAE\\\" data-mw=&apos;{\\\"parts\\\":[{\\\"template\\\":{\\\"target\\\":{\\\"wt\\\":\\\"Party shading/Republican\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"./Template:Party_shading/Republican\\\"},\\\"params\\\":{},\\\"i\\\":0}}]}&apos;>style=\\\"color:black; background-color:&lt;/span>&lt;span typeof=\\\"mw:Nowiki\\\" about=\\\"#mwt2074\\\">&lt;/span>&lt;span about=\\\"#mwt2074\\\">#FFB6B6\\\"&lt;/span>\"},{\"html\":\"\"}]]}'>Republican</td>\n<td id=\"mwDAM\">2025 <span style=\"font-size: 85%;\" about=\"#mwt2076\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwDAQ\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"small\",