\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barry_Moore_(American_politician)\" title=\"Barry Moore (American politician)\">Barry Moore</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Everett Wess</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Alabama\" title=\"List of United States senators from Alabama\">U.S. senator</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tommy_Tuberville\" title=\"Tommy Tuberville\">Tommy Tuberville</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2889\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEQM\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 United States Senate election in Alabama\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2890\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2889\" id=\"mwEQQ\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_Senate_election_in_Alabama\" title=\"2026 United States Senate election in Alabama\">2026 United States Senate election in Alabama</a></div>\n\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2891\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEQU\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"See also\",\"href\":\"./Template:See_also\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"List of United States senators from Alabama\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2892\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2891\" id=\"mwEQY\">See also: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Alabama\" title=\"List of United States senators from Alabama\">List of United States senators from Alabama</a></div>\n<p id=\"mwEQc\">Republican <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tommy_Tuberville\" title=\"Tommy Tuberville\" id=\"mwEQg\">Tommy Tuberville</a>, who was elected in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_United_States_Senate_election_in_Alabama\" title=\"2020 United States Senate election in Alabama\" id=\"mwEQk\">2020</a> with 60.1% of the vote, initially planned to seek reelection. But on May 27, 2025, he announced that he would instead run for <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Alabama_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2026 Alabama gubernatorial election\" id=\"mwEQo\">governor of Alabama</a>.<sup about=\"#mwt2895\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-o472_151-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"o472\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-o472-151\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-o472-151\" id=\"mwEQs\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEQw\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEQ0\">[</span>127<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEQ4\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<p id=\"mwEQ8\">Held on May 19, the Republican primary featured U.S. Representative <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barry_Moore_(American_politician)\" title=\"Barry Moore (American politician)\" id=\"mwERA\">Barry Moore</a>,<sup about=\"#mwt2898\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-152\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-152\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-152\" id=\"mwERE\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwERI\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwERM\">[</span>128<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwERQ\">]</span></span></a></sup> former <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Navy_SEAL\" title=\"Navy SEAL\" class=\"mw-redirect\" id=\"mwERU\">Navy SEAL</a> Jared Hudson,<sup about=\"#mwt2901\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-153\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-153\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-153\" id=\"mwERY\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwERc\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwERg\">[</span>129<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwERk\">]</span></span></a></sup> and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attorney_general_of_Alabama\" title=\"Attorney general of Alabama\" class=\"mw-redirect\" id=\"mwERo\">state attorney general</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steve_Marshall\" title=\"Steve Marshall\" id=\"mwERs\">Steve Marshall</a>.<sup about=\"#mwt2904\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-MarshallAL_154-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"MarshallAL\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-MarshallAL-154\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-MarshallAL-154\" id=\"mwERw\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwER0\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwER4\">[</span>130<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwER8\">]</span></span></a></sup> Since no candidate reached 50%, a runoff was held on June 16 between the top two finishers. Moore won the runoff, becoming the Republican nominee.</p>\n\n<p id=\"mwESA\">In the Democratic primary, no candidate received 50%, so a runoff was held between businessman Dakarai Larriet and attorney Everett Wess.<sup about=\"#mwt2907\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Larriett_155-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Larriett\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Larriett-155\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Larriett-155\" id=\"mwESE\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwESI\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwESM\">[</span>131<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwESQ\">]</span></span></a></sup> Wess won the runoff with 54.6% of the vote.<sup about=\"#mwt2910\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-:5_156-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\":5\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-:5-156\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-:5-156\" id=\"mwESU\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwESY\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwESc\">[</span>132<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwESg\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt2911\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwESk\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"22\" id=\"mwESo\" aria-labelledby=\"Alaska\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Alaska\">Alaska</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=22\" title=\"Edit section: Alaska\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2912\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwESs\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Infobox election\\n\",\"href\":\"./Template:Infobox_election\"},\"params\":{\"election_name\":{\"wt\":\"Alaska election\"},\"country\":{\"wt\":\"Alaska\"},\"type\":{\"wt\":\"presidential\"},\"ongoing\":{\"wt\":\"yes\"},\"previous_election\":{\"wt\":\"2020 United States Senate election in Alaska\"},\"previous_year\":{\"wt\":\"2020\"},\"next_election\":{\"wt\":\"2032 United States Senate election in Alaska\"},\"next_year\":{\"wt\":\"&apos;&apos;2032&apos;&apos;\"},\"election_date\":{\"wt\":\"&lt;!--Don&apos;t need election date in section infoboxes when the date is the same as in the article&apos;s main infobox.-->\"},\"image_size\":{\"wt\":\"125x136px\"},\"turnout\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image1\":{\"wt\":\"File:Senator Sullivan Memorial Day 2024 (cropped).jpg\"},\"candidate1\":{\"wt\":\"[[Dan Sullivan (U.S. senator)|Dan S. Sullivan]]\"},\"party1\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"wt\":\"Mary Peltola Congressional Member Portrait (2) (cropped).jpeg\"},\"candidate2\":{\"wt\":\"[[Mary Peltola]]\"},\"party2\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_image\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_size\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_caption\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"title\":{\"wt\":\"U.S. Senator\"},\"before_election\":{\"wt\":\"[[Dan Sullivan (U.S. senator)|Dan S. Sullivan]]\"},\"before_party\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"after_election\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"after_party\":{\"wt\":\"\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" about=\"#mwt2913\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" about=\"#mwt2914\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Infobox election/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" about=\"#mwt2915\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Screen reader-only/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" about=\"#mwt2912\" id=\"mwESw\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Alaska election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Alaska.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Flag_of_Alaska.svg/60px-Flag_of_Alaska.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Flag_of_Alaska.svg/120px-Flag_of_Alaska.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" alt=\"\" data-file-width=\"1416\" data-file-height=\"1000\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"35\" width=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></span></span></span><hr/></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">←</span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_United_States_Senate_election_in_Alaska\" title=\"2020 United States Senate election in Alaska\">2020</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><i>2032</i><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">→</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Senator_Sullivan_Memorial_Day_2024_(cropped).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Senator_Sullivan_Memorial_Day_2024_(cropped).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Senator_Sullivan_Memorial_Day_2024_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-Senator_Sullivan_Memorial_Day_2024_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Senator_Sullivan_Memorial_Day_2024_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Senator_Sullivan_Memorial_Day_2024_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2309\" data-file-height=\"3134\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"136\" width=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Mary_Peltola_Congressional_Member_Portrait_(2)_(cropped).jpeg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Mary_Peltola_Congressional_Member_Portrait_(2)_(cropped).jpeg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Mary_Peltola_Congressional_Member_Portrait_%282%29_%28cropped%29.jpeg/120px-Mary_Peltola_Congressional_Member_Portrait_%282%29_%28cropped%29.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Mary_Peltola_Congressional_Member_Portrait_%282%29_%28cropped%29.jpeg/250px-Mary_Peltola_Congressional_Member_Portrait_%282%29_%28cropped%29.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2400\" data-file-height=\"2963\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"136\" width=\"110\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Candidate</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dan_Sullivan_(U.S._senator)\" title=\"Dan Sullivan (U.S. senator)\">Dan S. Sullivan</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mary_Peltola\" title=\"Mary Peltola\">Mary Peltola</a></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Alaska\" title=\"List of United States senators from Alaska\">U.S. senator</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dan_Sullivan_(U.S._senator)\" title=\"Dan Sullivan (U.S. senator)\">Dan S. Sullivan</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2916\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwES0\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 United States Senate election in Alaska\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2917\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2916\" id=\"mwES4\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_Senate_election_in_Alaska\" title=\"2026 United States Senate election in Alaska\">2026 United States Senate election in Alaska</a></div>\n\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2918\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwES8\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"See also\",\"href\":\"./Template:See_also\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"List of United States senators from Alaska\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2919\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2918\" id=\"mwETA\">See also: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Alaska\" title=\"List of United States senators from Alaska\">List of United States senators from Alaska</a></div>\n<p id=\"mwETE\">Two-term Republican <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dan_Sullivan_(U.S._senator)\" title=\"Dan Sullivan (U.S. senator)\" id=\"mwETI\">Dan S. Sullivan</a> was <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_United_States_Senate_election_in_Alaska\" title=\"2020 United States Senate election in Alaska\" id=\"mwETM\">reelected in 2020</a> with 53.9% of the vote. He is running for reelection to a third term.<sup about=\"#mwt2922\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-157\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-157\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-157\" id=\"mwETQ\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwETU\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwETY\">[</span>133<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwETc\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<p id=\"mwETg\">A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nonpartisan_primary\" title=\"Nonpartisan primary\" id=\"mwETk\">nonpartisan primary</a> was held on August 18, 2026, with the top four candidates advancing to the general election, which will be conducted using <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ranked-choice_voting_in_the_United_States\" title=\"Ranked-choice voting in the United States\" id=\"mwETo\">ranked-choice voting</a>. The advancing candidates are incumbent Republican senator Dan S. Sullivan, perennial Republican candidate Gerald Heikes,<sup about=\"#mwt2925\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-:6_158-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\":6\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-:6-158\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-:6-158\" id=\"mwETs\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwETw\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwET0\">[</span>134<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwET4\">]</span></span></a></sup> former Democratic U.S. representative <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mary_Peltola\" title=\"Mary Peltola\" id=\"mwET8\">Mary Peltola</a>, and former <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_Forest_Service\" title=\"United States Forest Service\" id=\"mwEUA\">U.S. Forest Service</a> employee Dan J. Sullivan, despite efforts to disqualify him.<sup about=\"#mwt2928\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-159\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-159\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-159\" id=\"mwEUE\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEUI\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEUM\">[</span>135<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEUQ\">]</span></span></a></sup> Some Republicans have alleged that Dan J. Sullivan's candidacy is intended to confuse voters seeking to support the incumbent senator, who shares his first and last names.<sup about=\"#mwt2931\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-160\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-160\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-160\" id=\"mwEUU\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEUY\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEUc\">[</span>136<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEUg\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt2932\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEUk\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"23\" id=\"mwEUo\" aria-labelledby=\"Arkansas\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Arkansas\">Arkansas</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=23\" title=\"Edit section: Arkansas\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2933\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEUs\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Infobox election\\n\",\"href\":\"./Template:Infobox_election\"},\"params\":{\"election_name\":{\"wt\":\"Arkansas election\"},\"country\":{\"wt\":\"Arkansas\"},\"type\":{\"wt\":\"presidential\"},\"ongoing\":{\"wt\":\"yes\"},\"previous_election\":{\"wt\":\"2020 United States Senate election in Arkansas\"},\"previous_year\":{\"wt\":\"2020\"},\"next_election\":{\"wt\":\"2032 United States Senate election in Arkansas\"},\"next_year\":{\"wt\":\"&apos;&apos;2032&apos;&apos;\"},\"election_date\":{\"wt\":\"&lt;!--Don&apos;t need election date in section infoboxes when the date is the same as in the article&apos;s main infobox.-->\"},\"image_size\":{\"wt\":\"125x136px\"},\"turnout\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image1\":{\"wt\":\"Tom_Cotton_official_Senate_photo_(cropped).jpg\"},\"nominee1\":{\"wt\":\"[[Tom Cotton]]\"},\"party1\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"wt\":\"Hallie Shoffner (cropped 2).jpg\"},\"nominee2\":{\"wt\":\"[[Hallie Shoffner]]\"},\"party2\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_image\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_size\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_caption\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"title\":{\"wt\":\"U.S. Senator\"},\"before_election\":{\"wt\":\"[[Tom Cotton]]\"},\"before_party\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"after_election\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"after_party\":{\"wt\":\"\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" about=\"#mwt2934\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" about=\"#mwt2935\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Infobox election/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" about=\"#mwt2936\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Screen reader-only/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" about=\"#mwt2933\" id=\"mwEUw\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Arkansas election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Arkansas.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Flag_of_Arkansas.svg/60px-Flag_of_Arkansas.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Flag_of_Arkansas.svg/120px-Flag_of_Arkansas.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" alt=\"\" data-file-width=\"450\" data-file-height=\"300\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"33\" width=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></span></span></span><hr/></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">←</span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_United_States_Senate_election_in_Arkansas\" title=\"2020 United States Senate election in Arkansas\">2020</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><i>2032</i><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">→</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Tom_Cotton_official_Senate_photo_(cropped).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Tom_Cotton_official_Senate_photo_(cropped).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Tom_Cotton_official_Senate_photo_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-Tom_Cotton_official_Senate_photo_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Tom_Cotton_official_Senate_photo_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Tom_Cotton_official_Senate_photo_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"796\" data-file-height=\"1061\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"136\" width=\"102\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Hallie_Shoffner_(cropped_2).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Hallie_Shoffner_(cropped_2).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7c/Hallie_Shoffner_%28cropped_2%29.jpg/120px-Hallie_Shoffner_%28cropped_2%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7c/Hallie_Shoffner_%28cropped_2%29.jpg/250px-Hallie_Shoffner_%28cropped_2%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"472\" data-file-height=\"629\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"136\" width=\"102\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tom_Cotton\" title=\"Tom Cotton\">Tom Cotton</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hallie_Shoffner\" title=\"Hallie Shoffner\">Hallie Shoffner</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Arkansas\" title=\"List of United States senators from Arkansas\">U.S. senator</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tom_Cotton\" title=\"Tom Cotton\">Tom Cotton</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2937\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEU0\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 United States Senate election in Arkansas\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2938\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2937\" id=\"mwEU4\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_Senate_election_in_Arkansas\" title=\"2026 United States Senate election in Arkansas\">2026 United States Senate election in Arkansas</a></div>\n\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2939\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEU8\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"See also\",\"href\":\"./Template:See_also\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"List of United States senators from Arkansas\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2940\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2939\" id=\"mwEVA\">See also: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Arkansas\" title=\"List of United States senators from Arkansas\">List of United States senators from Arkansas</a></div>\n<p id=\"mwEVE\">Two-term Republican <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tom_Cotton\" title=\"Tom Cotton\" id=\"mwEVI\">Tom Cotton</a> was reelected in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_United_States_Senate_election_in_Arkansas\" title=\"2020 United States Senate election in Arkansas\" id=\"mwEVM\">2020</a> with 66.5% of the vote. Cotton is running for reelection,<sup about=\"#mwt2943\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Cotton_161-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Cotton\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Cotton-161\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Cotton-161\" id=\"mwEVQ\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEVU\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEVY\">[</span>137<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEVc\">]</span></span></a></sup> having secured the Republican nomination on March 3, 2026.</p>\n\n<p id=\"mwEVg\">Rice farmer Hallie Shoffner defeated Ethan Dunbar in the March 3 Democratic primary.<sup about=\"#mwt2946\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-162\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-162\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-162\" id=\"mwEVk\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEVo\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEVs\">[</span>138<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEVw\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt2947\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEV0\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"24\" id=\"mwEV4\" aria-labelledby=\"Colorado\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Colorado\">Colorado</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=24\" title=\"Edit section: Colorado\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2948\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEV8\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Infobox election\\n\",\"href\":\"./Template:Infobox_election\"},\"params\":{\"election_name\":{\"wt\":\"Colorado election\"},\"country\":{\"wt\":\"Colorado\"},\"type\":{\"wt\":\"presidential\"},\"ongoing\":{\"wt\":\"yes\"},\"previous_election\":{\"wt\":\"2020 United States Senate election in Colorado\"},\"previous_year\":{\"wt\":\"2020\"},\"next_election\":{\"wt\":\"2032 United States Senate election in Colorado\"},\"next_year\":{\"wt\":\"&apos;&apos;2032&apos;&apos;\"},\"election_date\":{\"wt\":\"&lt;!--Don&apos;t need election date in section infoboxes when the date is the same as in the article&apos;s main infobox.-->\"},\"image_size\":{\"wt\":\"125x136px\"},\"turnout\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image1\":{\"wt\":\"John Hickenlooper, official portrait, 117th Congress (cropped).jpeg\"},\"nominee1\":{\"wt\":\"[[John Hickenlooper]]\"},\"party1\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"wt\":\"Mark Baisley in 2024 (cropped).jpg\"},\"nominee2\":{\"wt\":\"[[Mark Baisley]]\"},\"party2\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_image\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_size\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_caption\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"title\":{\"wt\":\"U.S. Senator\"},\"before_election\":{\"wt\":\"[[John Hickenlooper]]\"},\"before_party\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"after_election\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"after_party\":{\"wt\":\"\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" about=\"#mwt2949\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" about=\"#mwt2950\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Infobox election/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" about=\"#mwt2951\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Screen reader-only/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" about=\"#mwt2948\" id=\"mwEWA\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Colorado election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Colorado.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Flag_of_Colorado.svg/60px-Flag_of_Colorado.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Flag_of_Colorado.svg/120px-Flag_of_Colorado.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" alt=\"\" data-file-width=\"1800\" data-file-height=\"1200\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"33\" width=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></span></span></span><hr/></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">←</span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_United_States_Senate_election_in_Colorado\" title=\"2020 United States Senate election in Colorado\">2020</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><i>2032</i><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">→</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:John_Hickenlooper,_official_portrait,_117th_Congress_(cropped).jpeg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:John_Hickenlooper,_official_portrait,_117th_Congress_(cropped).jpeg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/John_Hickenlooper%2C_official_portrait%2C_117th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpeg/120px-John_Hickenlooper%2C_official_portrait%2C_117th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/John_Hickenlooper%2C_official_portrait%2C_117th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpeg/250px-John_Hickenlooper%2C_official_portrait%2C_117th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2160\" data-file-height=\"2700\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"136\" width=\"109\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Mark_Baisley_in_2024_(cropped).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Mark_Baisley_in_2024_(cropped).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/Mark_Baisley_in_2024_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-Mark_Baisley_in_2024_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/Mark_Baisley_in_2024_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Mark_Baisley_in_2024_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"914\" data-file-height=\"1220\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"136\" width=\"102\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Hickenlooper\" title=\"John Hickenlooper\">John Hickenlooper</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Baisley\" title=\"Mark Baisley\">Mark Baisley</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Colorado\" title=\"List of United States senators from Colorado\">U.S. senator</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Hickenlooper\" title=\"John Hickenlooper\">John Hickenlooper</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2952\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEWE\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 United States Senate election in Colorado\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2953\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2952\" id=\"mwEWI\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_Senate_election_in_Colorado\" title=\"2026 United States Senate election in Colorado\">2026 United States Senate election in Colorado</a></div>\n\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2954\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEWM\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"See also\",\"href\":\"./Template:See_also\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"List of United States senators from Colorado\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2955\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2954\" id=\"mwEWQ\">See also: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Colorado\" title=\"List of United States senators from Colorado\">List of United States senators from Colorado</a></div>\n<p id=\"mwEWU\">One-term <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\" id=\"mwEWY\">Democrat</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Hickenlooper\" title=\"John Hickenlooper\" id=\"mwEWc\">John Hickenlooper</a>, elected with 53.5% of the vote in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_United_States_Senate_election_in_Colorado\" title=\"2020 United States Senate election in Colorado\" id=\"mwEWg\">2020</a>, is running for reelection for a second term, and has said it will be his last term.<sup about=\"#mwt2958\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Denver_Gazette_163-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Denver Gazette\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Denver_Gazette-163\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Denver_Gazette-163\" id=\"mwEWk\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEWo\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEWs\">[</span>139<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEWw\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt2961\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-164\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-164\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-164\" id=\"mwEW0\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEW4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEW8\">[</span>140<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEXA\">]</span></span></a></sup> Hickenlooper defeated <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Progressivism_in_the_United_States\" title=\"Progressivism in the United States\" id=\"mwEXE\">progressive</a> state Senator <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Julie_Gonzales\" title=\"Julie Gonzales\" id=\"mwEXI\">Julie Gonzales</a> in the Democratic primary, 53% to 47%.<sup about=\"#mwt2964\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-GonzalesCO_165-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"GonzalesCO\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-GonzalesCO-165\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-GonzalesCO-165\" id=\"mwEXM\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEXQ\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEXU\">[</span>141<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEXY\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt2967\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-BreslinCO_166-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"BreslinCO\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-BreslinCO-166\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-BreslinCO-166\" id=\"mwEXc\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEXg\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEXk\">[</span>142<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEXo\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<p id=\"mwEXs\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colorado_Senate\" title=\"Colorado Senate\" id=\"mwEXw\">State Senator</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Baisley\" title=\"Mark Baisley\" id=\"mwEX0\">Mark Baisley</a> is the Republican nominee following the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colorado_Republican_Party\" title=\"Colorado Republican Party\" id=\"mwEX4\">Colorado Republican</a> Assembly on April 11, as no other candidates surpassed the 30% threshold.<sup about=\"#mwt2970\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-167\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-167\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-167\" id=\"mwEX8\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEYA\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEYE\">[</span>143<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEYI\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt2973\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Baisley_168-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Baisley\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Baisley-168\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Baisley-168\" id=\"mwEYM\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEYQ\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEYU\">[</span>144<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEYY\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt2974\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEYc\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"25\" id=\"mwEYg\" aria-labelledby=\"Delaware\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Delaware\">Delaware</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=25\" title=\"Edit section: Delaware\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2975\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEYk\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Infobox election\\n\",\"href\":\"./Template:Infobox_election\"},\"params\":{\"election_name\":{\"wt\":\"Delaware election\"},\"country\":{\"wt\":\"Delaware\"},\"type\":{\"wt\":\"presidential\"},\"ongoing\":{\"wt\":\"yes\"},\"previous_election\":{\"wt\":\"2020 United States Senate election in Delaware\"},\"previous_year\":{\"wt\":\"2020\"},\"next_election\":{\"wt\":\"2032 United States Senate election in Delaware\"},\"next_year\":{\"wt\":\"&apos;&apos;2032&apos;&apos;\"},\"image_size\":{\"wt\":\"125x136px\"},\"image1\":{\"wt\":\"Chris Coons 2024.jpg\"},\"nominee1\":{\"wt\":\"[[Chris Coons]]\"},\"party1\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"wt\":\"3x4.svg\"},\"nominee2\":{\"wt\":\"[[Michael Katz (politician)|Michael Katz]]\"},\"party2\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_image\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_size\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_caption\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"title\":{\"wt\":\"U.S. senator\"},\"before_election\":{\"wt\":\"[[Chris Coons]]\"},\"before_party\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"after_election\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"after_party\":{\"wt\":\"\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" about=\"#mwt2976\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" about=\"#mwt2977\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Infobox election/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" about=\"#mwt2978\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Screen reader-only/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" about=\"#mwt2975\" id=\"mwEYo\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Delaware election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\