t=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Chris_Coons_2024.jpg/250px-Chris_Coons_2024.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1159\" data-file-height=\"1529\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"136\" width=\"103\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:3x4.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:3x4.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/3x4.svg/120px-3x4.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/3x4.svg/250px-3x4.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"3\" data-file-height=\"4\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"136\" width=\"102\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chris_Coons\" title=\"Chris Coons\">Chris Coons</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Michael_Katz_(politician)\" title=\"Michael Katz (politician)\">Michael Katz</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Delaware\" title=\"List of United States senators from Delaware\">U.S. senator</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chris_Coons\" title=\"Chris Coons\">Chris Coons</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2979\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEYs\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 United States Senate election in Delaware\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2980\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2979\" id=\"mwEYw\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_Senate_election_in_Delaware\" title=\"2026 United States Senate election in Delaware\">2026 United States Senate election in Delaware</a></div>\n\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2981\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEY0\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"See also\",\"href\":\"./Template:See_also\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"List of United States senators from Delaware\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2982\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2981\" id=\"mwEY4\">See also: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Delaware\" title=\"List of United States senators from Delaware\">List of United States senators from Delaware</a></div>\n<p id=\"mwEY8\">Two-term Democrat <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chris_Coons\" title=\"Chris Coons\" id=\"mwEZA\">Chris Coons</a> was <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_United_States_Senate_election_in_Delaware\" title=\"2020 United States Senate election in Delaware\" id=\"mwEZE\">reelected in 2020</a> with 59.4% of the vote and is running for reelection.<sup about=\"#mwt2985\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-:02_169-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\":02\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-:02-169\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-:02-169\" id=\"mwEZI\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEZM\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEZQ\">[</span>145<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEZU\">]</span></span></a></sup></p> \n\n<p id=\"mwEZY\">Coons faced three challengers in the Democratic primary: philosopher and educator Jeff Appelhans, E. No-Trump Hansen, and domestic violence advocate Mary Louve.<sup about=\"#mwt2986\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-:02_169-1\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\":02\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-:02-169\" id=\"mwEZc\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEZg\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEZk\">[</span>145<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEZo\">]</span></span></a></sup> Coons won the nomination with approximately 78% of the vote.<sup about=\"#mwt2989\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-:11_170-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\":11\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-:11-170\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-:11-170\" id=\"mwEZs\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEZw\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEZ0\">[</span>146<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEZ4\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<p id=\"mwEZ8\">Former Democratic <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Delaware_Senate\" title=\"Delaware Senate\" id=\"mwEaA\">state Senator</a> and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Independent_Party_of_Delaware\" title=\"Independent Party of Delaware\" id=\"mwEaE\">Independent Party of Delaware</a> nominee for U.S. Senate in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Delaware\" title=\"2024 United States Senate election in Delaware\" id=\"mwEaI\">2024</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Michael_Katz_(politician)\" title=\"Michael Katz (politician)\" id=\"mwEaM\">Michael Katz</a> defeated <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/U.S._Army_War_College\" title=\"U.S. Army War College\" class=\"mw-redirect\" id=\"mwEaQ\">U.S. Army War College</a> instructor John Shulli in the Republican primary.<sup about=\"#mwt2990\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-:11_170-1\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\":11\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-:11-170\" id=\"mwEaU\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEaY\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEac\">[</span>146<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEag\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt2991\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEak\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"26\" id=\"mwEao\" aria-labelledby=\"Florida_(special)\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Florida_(special)\"><span id=\"Florida_.28special.29\" typeof=\"mw:FallbackId\"></span>Florida (special)</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=26\" title=\"Edit section: Florida (special)\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2992\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEas\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Infobox election\\n\",\"href\":\"./Template:Infobox_election\"},\"params\":{\"election_name\":{\"wt\":\"Florida special election\"},\"country\":{\"wt\":\"Florida\"},\"type\":{\"wt\":\"presidential\"},\"ongoing\":{\"wt\":\"yes\"},\"previous_election\":{\"wt\":\"2022 United States Senate election in Florida\"},\"previous_year\":{\"wt\":\"2022\"},\"next_election\":{\"wt\":\"2028 United States Senate election in Florida\"},\"next_year\":{\"wt\":\"&apos;&apos;2028&apos;&apos;\"},\"election_date\":{\"wt\":\"&lt;!--Don&apos;t need election date in section infoboxes when the date is the same as in the article&apos;s main infobox.-->\"},\"image_size\":{\"wt\":\"125x136px\"},\"turnout\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image1\":{\"wt\":\"Official Portrait of Senator Ashley Moody (cropped 2).jpg\"},\"nominee1\":{\"wt\":\"[[Ashley Moody]]\"},\"party1\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"wt\":\"File:Angie Nixon official portrait 2022 (cropped).jpg\"},\"nominee2\":{\"wt\":\"[[Angie Nixon]]\"},\"party2\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_image\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_size\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_caption\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"title\":{\"wt\":\"U.S. Senator\"},\"before_election\":{\"wt\":\"[[Ashley Moody]]\"},\"before_party\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"after_election\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"after_party\":{\"wt\":\"\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" about=\"#mwt2993\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" about=\"#mwt2994\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Infobox election/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" about=\"#mwt2995\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Screen reader-only/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" about=\"#mwt2992\" id=\"mwEaw\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Florida special election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Florida.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Flag_of_Florida.svg/60px-Flag_of_Florida.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Flag_of_Florida.svg/120px-Flag_of_Florida.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" alt=\"\" data-file-width=\"4500\" data-file-height=\"3000\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"33\" width=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></span></span></span><hr/></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">←</span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Florida\" title=\"2022 United States Senate election in Florida\">2022</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2028_United_States_Senate_election_in_Florida\" title=\"2028 United States Senate election in Florida\" class=\"mw-redirect\"><i>2028</i></a><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">→</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Official_Portrait_of_Senator_Ashley_Moody_(cropped_2).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Official_Portrait_of_Senator_Ashley_Moody_(cropped_2).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Official_Portrait_of_Senator_Ashley_Moody_%28cropped_2%29.jpg/120px-Official_Portrait_of_Senator_Ashley_Moody_%28cropped_2%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Official_Portrait_of_Senator_Ashley_Moody_%28cropped_2%29.jpg/250px-Official_Portrait_of_Senator_Ashley_Moody_%28cropped_2%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1313\" data-file-height=\"1750\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"136\" width=\"102\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Angie_Nixon_official_portrait_2022_(cropped).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Angie_Nixon_official_portrait_2022_(cropped).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/Angie_Nixon_official_portrait_2022_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-Angie_Nixon_official_portrait_2022_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/Angie_Nixon_official_portrait_2022_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Angie_Nixon_official_portrait_2022_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"662\" data-file-height=\"883\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"136\" width=\"102\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashley_Moody\" title=\"Ashley Moody\">Ashley Moody</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angie_Nixon\" title=\"Angie Nixon\">Angie Nixon</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Florida\" title=\"List of United States senators from Florida\">U.S. senator</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashley_Moody\" title=\"Ashley Moody\">Ashley Moody</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2996\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEa0\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 United States Senate special election in Florida\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2997\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2996\" id=\"mwEa4\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_Senate_special_election_in_Florida\" title=\"2026 United States Senate special election in Florida\">2026 United States Senate special election in Florida</a></div>\n\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt2998\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEa8\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"See also\",\"href\":\"./Template:See_also\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"List of United States senators from Florida\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt2999\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt2998\" id=\"mwEbA\">See also: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Florida\" title=\"List of United States senators from Florida\">List of United States senators from Florida</a></div>\n<p id=\"mwEbE\">Three-term Republican <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marco_Rubio\" title=\"Marco Rubio\" id=\"mwEbI\">Marco Rubio</a> was <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Florida\" title=\"2022 United States Senate election in Florida\" id=\"mwEbM\">reelected in 2022</a> with 57.68% of the vote. He resigned on January 20, 2025, following his confirmation as <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_Secretary_of_State\" title=\"United States Secretary of State\" id=\"mwEbQ\">U.S. Secretary of State</a>. <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Governor_of_Florida\" title=\"Governor of Florida\" id=\"mwEbU\">Governor</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ron_DeSantis\" title=\"Ron DeSantis\" id=\"mwEbY\">Ron DeSantis</a> subsequently appointed <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attorney_General_of_Florida\" title=\"Attorney General of Florida\" class=\"mw-redirect\" id=\"mwEbc\">Florida Attorney General</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashley_Moody\" title=\"Ashley Moody\" id=\"mwEbg\">Ashley Moody</a> to serve as interim senator until the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_Senate_special_election_in_Florida\" title=\"2026 United States Senate special election in Florida\" id=\"mwEbk\">2026 special election</a>.<sup about=\"#mwt3002\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-171\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-171\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-171\" id=\"mwEbo\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEbs\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEbw\">[</span>147<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEb0\">]</span></span></a></sup> Moody ran to serve the remainder of Rubio's term and won the Republican nomination in the August 18 primary.<sup about=\"#mwt3005\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-moody50_172-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"moody50\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-moody50-172\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-moody50-172\" id=\"mwEb4\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEb8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEcA\">[</span>148<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEcE\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<p id=\"mwEcI\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Florida_House_of_Representatives\" title=\"Florida House of Representatives\" id=\"mwEcM\">State Representative</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angie_Nixon\" title=\"Angie Nixon\" id=\"mwEcQ\">Angie Nixon</a><sup about=\"#mwt3008\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-173\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-173\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-173\" id=\"mwEcU\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEcY\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEcc\">[</span>149<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEcg\">]</span></span></a></sup> defeated <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alex_Vindman\" title=\"Alex Vindman\" id=\"mwEck\">Alex Vindman</a>, former director for European affairs at the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_National_Security_Council\" title=\"United States National Security Council\" id=\"mwEco\">U.S. National Security Council</a>, a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whistleblowing\" title=\"Whistleblowing\" id=\"mwEcs\">whistleblower</a> in the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2019_Trump–Ukraine_scandal\" title=\"2019 Trump–Ukraine scandal\" id=\"mwEcw\">2019 Trump–Ukraine scandal</a>, and the twin brother of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Virginia\" title=\"Virginia\" id=\"mwEc0\">Virginia</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/U.S._Representative\" title=\"U.S. Representative\" class=\"mw-redirect\" id=\"mwEc4\">U.S. Representative</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eugene_Vindman\" title=\"Eugene Vindman\" id=\"mwEc8\">Eugene Vindman</a><sup about=\"#mwt3011\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-174\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-174\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-174\" id=\"mwEdA\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEdE\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEdI\">[</span>150<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEdM\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt3014\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-175\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-175\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-175\" id=\"mwEdQ\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEdU\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEdY\">[</span>151<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEdc\">]</span></span></a></sup> in the August 18 Democratic primary.</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt3015\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEdg\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"27\" id=\"mwEdk\" aria-labelledby=\"Georgia\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Georgia\">Georgia</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=27\" title=\"Edit section: Georgia\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt3016\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEdo\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Infobox election\\n\",\"href\":\"./Template:Infobox_election\"},\"params\":{\"election_name\":{\"wt\":\"Georgia election\"},\"country\":{\"wt\":\"Georgia (U.S. state)\"},\"type\":{\"wt\":\"presidential\"},\"ongoing\":{\"wt\":\"yes\"},\"previous_election\":{\"wt\":\"2020–21 United States Senate election in Georgia\"},\"previous_year\":{\"wt\":\"2020–21\"},\"next_election\":{\"wt\":\"2032 United States Senate election in Georgia\"},\"next_year\":{\"wt\":\"&apos;&apos;2032&apos;&apos;\"},\"election_date\":{\"wt\":\"&lt;!--Don&apos;t need election date in section infoboxes when the date is the same as in the article&apos;s main infobox.-->\"},\"image_size\":{\"wt\":\"125x136px\"},\"turnout\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image1\":{\"wt\":\"Jon Ossoff Senate Portrait 2021 (cropped).jpg\"},\"nominee1\":{\"wt\":\"[[Jon Ossoff]]\"},\"party1\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"wt\":\"Rep. Mike Collins official photo, 118th Congress (cropped).jpg\"},\"nominee2\":{\"wt\":\"[[Mike Collins (politician)|Mike Collins]]\"},\"party2\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_image\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_size\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_caption\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"title\":{\"wt\":\"U.S. Senator\"},\"before_election\":{\"wt\":\"[[Jon Ossoff]]\"},\"before_party\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"after_election\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"after_party\":{\"wt\":\"\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" about=\"#mwt3017\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" about=\"#mwt3018\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Infobox election/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" about=\"#mwt3019\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Screen reader-only/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" about=\"#mwt3016\" id=\"mwEds\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Georgia election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Georgia_(U.S._state).svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/Flag_of_the_State_of_Georgia.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_State_of_Georgia.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/Flag_of_the_State_of_Georgia.svg/120px-Flag_of_the_State_of_Georgia.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" alt=\"\" data-file-width=\"960\" data-file-height=\"600\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"31\" width=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></span></span></span><hr/></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">←</span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020–21_United_States_Senate_election_in_Georgia\" title=\"2020–21 United States Senate election in Georgia\">2020–21</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><i>2032</i><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">→</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Jon_Ossoff_Senate_Portrait_2021_(cropped).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Jon_Ossoff_Senate_Portrait_2021_(cropped).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/Jon_Ossoff_Senate_Portrait_2021_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-Jon_Ossoff_Senate_Portrait_2021_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/Jon_Ossoff_Senate_Portrait_2021_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Jon_Ossoff_Senate_Portrait_2021_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2447\" data-file-height=\"3238\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"136\" width=\"103\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Rep._Mike_Collins_official_photo,_118th_Congress_(cropped).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Rep._Mike_Collins_official_photo,_118th_Congress_(cropped).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Rep._Mike_Collins_official_photo%2C_118th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-Rep._Mike_Collins_official_photo%2C_118th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Rep._Mike_Collins_official_photo%2C_118th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Rep._Mike_Collins_official_photo%2C_118th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"312\" data-file-height=\"412\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"136\" width=\"103\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jon_Ossoff\" title=\"Jon Ossoff\">Jon Ossoff</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mike_Collins_(politician)\" title=\"Mike Collins (politician)\">Mike Collins</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Georgia\" title=\"List of United States senators from Georgia\">U.S. senator</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jon_Ossoff\" title=\"Jon Ossoff\">Jon Ossoff</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt3020\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEdw\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 United States Senate election in Georgia\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt3021\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt3020\" id=\"mwEd0\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_Senate_election_in_Georgia\" title=\"2026 United States Senate election in Georgia\">2026 United States Senate election in Georgia</a></div>\n\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt3022\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEd4\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"See also\",\"href\":\"./Template:See_also\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"List of United States senators from Georgia\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt3023\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt3022\" id=\"mwEd8\">See also: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Georgia\" title=\"List of United States senators from Georgia\">List of United States senators from Georgia</a></div>\n<p id=\"mwEeA\">One-term Democrat <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jon_Ossoff\" title=\"Jon Ossoff\" id=\"mwEeE\">Jon Ossoff</a> is running for a second term.<sup about=\"#mwt3026\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Ossoff_176-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Ossoff\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Ossoff-176\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Ossoff-176\" id=\"mwEeI\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEeM\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEeQ\">[</span>152<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEeU\">]</span></span></a></sup> He was narrowly elected in a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020–21_United_States_Senate_election_in_Georgia\" title=\"2020–21 United States Senate election in Georgia\" id=\"mwEeY\">2021 runoff</a> with 50.6% of the vote. Ossoff won the Democratic nomination unopposed, as he was the only candidate to submit the required number of signatures to appear on the primary ballot.<sup about=\"#mwt3029\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-177\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-177\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-177\" id=\"mwEec\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEeg\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEek\">[</span>153<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEeo\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<p id=\"mwEes\">The Republican primary took place on May 19. U.S. Representative <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mike_Collins_(politician)\" title=\"Mike Collins (politician)\" id=\"mwEew\">Mike Collins</a><sup about=\"#mwt3032\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-178\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-178\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-178\" id=\"mwEe0\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEe4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEe8\">[</span>154<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEfA\">]</span></span></a></sup> and former <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/University_of_Tennessee_football\" title=\"University of Tennessee football\" class=\"mw-redirect\" id=\"mwEfE\">University of Tennessee football</a> coach <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Derek_Dooley_(American_football)\" title=\"Derek Dooley (American football)\" id=\"mwEfI\">Derek Dooley</a><sup about=\"#mwt3035\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-179\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-179\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-179\" id=\"mwEfM\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEfQ\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEfU\">[</span>155<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEfY\">]</span></span></a></sup> advanced to a June 16 runoff, which Collins won with 56% of the vote.<sup about=\"#mwt3038\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-180\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-180\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-180\" id=\"mwEfc\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEfg\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEfk\">[</span>156<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEfo\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt3039\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEfs\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"28\" id=\"mwEfw\" aria-labelledby=\"Idaho\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Idaho\">Idaho</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=28\" title=\"Edit section: Idaho\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt3040\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEf0\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Infobox election\\n\",\"href\":\"./Template:Infobox_election\"},\"params\":{\"election_name\":{\"wt\":\"Idaho election\"},\"country\":{\"wt\":\"Idaho\"},\"type\":{\"wt\":\"presidential\"},\"ongoing\":{\"wt\":\"yes\"},\"previous_election\":{\"wt\":\"2020 United States Senate election in Idaho\"},\"previous_year\":{\"wt\":\"2020\"},\"next_election\":{\"wt\":\"2032 United States Senate election in Idaho\"},\"next_year\":{\"wt\":\"&apos;&apos;2032&apos;&apos;\"},\"election_date\":{\"wt\":\"&lt;!--Don&apos;t need election date in section infoboxes when the date is the same as in the article&apos;s main infobox.-->\"},\"image_size\":{\"wt\":\"125x136px\"},\"turnout\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image1\":{\"wt\":\"Jim Risch 2021 (cropped).jpg\"},\"nominee1\":{\"wt\":\"[[Jim Risch]]\"},\"party1\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"wt\":\"Todd Achilles on LibertyDad&apos;s stream.png\"},\"nominee2\":{\"wt\":\"[[Todd Achilles]]\"},\"party2\":{\"wt\":\"Independent politician\"},\"popular_vote2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_image\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_size\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_caption\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"title\":{\"wt\":\"U.S. Senator\"},\"before_election\":{\"wt\":\"[[Jim Risch]]\"},\"before_party\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"after_election\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"after_party\":{\"wt\":\"\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" about=\"#mwt3041\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" about=\"#mwt3042\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Infobox election/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" about=\"#mwt3043\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Screen reader-only/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" about=\"#mwt3040\" id=\"mwEf4\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Idaho election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Idaho.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Flag_of_Idaho.svg/60px-Flag_of_Idaho.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Flag_of_Idaho.svg/120px-Flag_of_Idaho.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" alt=\"\" data-file-width=\"3168\" data-file-height=\"2496\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"39\" width=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></span></span></span><hr/></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">←</span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_United_States_Senate_election_in_Idaho\" title=\"2020 United States Senate election in Idaho\">2020</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><i>2032</i><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">→</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Jim_Risch_2021_(cropped).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Jim_Risch_2021_(cropped).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/Jim_Risch_2021_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-Jim_Risch_2021_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/Jim_Risch_2021_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Jim_Risch_2021_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"482\" data-file-height=\"639\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"136\" width=\"102\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #DCDCDC;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Todd_Achilles_on_LibertyDad's_stream.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Todd_Achilles_on_LibertyDad's_stream.png\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/Todd_Achilles_on_LibertyDad%27s_stream.png/120px-Todd_Achilles_on_LibertyDad%27s_stream.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/Todd_Achilles_on_LibertyDad%27s_stream.png/250px-Todd_Achilles_on_LibertyDad%27s_stream.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"673\" data-file-height=\"909\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"136\" width=\"101\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jim_Risch\" title=\"Jim Risch\">Jim Risch</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Todd_Achilles\" title=\"Todd Achilles\">Todd Achilles</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Independent_politician\" title=\"Independent politician\">Independent</a></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Idaho\" title=\"List of United States senators from Idaho\">U.S. senator</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jim_Risch\" title=\"Jim Risch\">Jim Risch</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt3044\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEf8\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 United States Senate election in Idaho\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt3045\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt3044\" id=\"mwEgA\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_Senate_election_in_Idaho\" title=\"2026 United States Senate election in Idaho\">2026 United States Senate election in Idaho</a></div>\n\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt3046\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEgE\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"See also\",\"href\":\"./Template:See_also\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"List of United States senators from Idaho\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt3047\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt3046\" id=\"mwEgI\">See also: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Idaho\" title=\"List of United States senators from Idaho\">List of United States senators from Idaho</a></div>\n<p id=\"mwEgM\">Three-term Republican <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jim_Risch\" title=\"Jim Risch\" id=\"mwEgQ\">Jim Risch</a> was <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_United_States_Senate_election_in_Idaho\" title=\"2020 United States Senate election in Idaho\" id=\"mwEgU\">reelected in 2020</a> with 62.6% of the vote and is running for a fourth term.<sup about=\"#mwt3050\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Risch2_181-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Risch2\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Risch2-181\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Risch2-181\" id=\"mwEgY\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEgc\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEgg\">[</span>157<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEgk\">]</span></span></a></sup> He won the Republican nomination on May 19, defeating data engineer and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Idaho#District_1\" title=\"2020 United States House of Representatives elections in Idaho\" id=\"mwEgo\">2020</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Libertarian_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Libertarian Party (United States)\" id=\"mwEgs\">Libertarian</a> nominee for <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Idaho's_1st_congressional_district\" title=\"Idaho's 1st congressional district\" id=\"mwEgw\">Idaho's 1st congressional district</a> Joe Evans, entrepreneur Denny LaVe, and engineer Josh Roy.<sup about=\"#mwt3053\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-wr_182-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"wr\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-wr-182\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-wr-182\" id=\"mwEg0\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEg4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEg8\">[</span>158<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEhA\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<p id=\"mwEhE\">David Roth, a realtor and the Democratic nominee for U.S. Senate in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Idaho\" title=\"2022 United States Senate election in Idaho\" id=\"mwEhI\">2022</a>,<sup about=\"#mwt3056\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-183\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-183\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-183\" id=\"mwEhM\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEhQ\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEhU\">[</span>159<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEhY\">]</span></span></a></sup> defeated Nickolas Bonds and Brad Moore<sup about=\"#mwt3057\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-wr_182-1\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"wr\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-wr-182\" id=\"mwEhc\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEhg\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEhk\">[</span>158<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEho\">]</span></span></a></sup> in the May 19 Democratic primary,<sup about=\"#mwt3060\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-184\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-184\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-184\" id=\"mwEhs\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEhw\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEh0\">[</span>160<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEh4\">]</span></span></a></sup> but withdrew from the race on July 28.<sup about=\"#mwt3063\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-185\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-185\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-185\" id=\"mwEh8\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEiA\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEiE\">[</span>161<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEiI\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<p id=\"mwEiM\">Matt Loesby, the nominee for Idaho's 1st congressional district in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Idaho#District_1\" title=\"2024 United States House of Representatives elections in Idaho\" id=\"mwEiQ\">2024</a>,<sup about=\"#mwt3066\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-186\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-186\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-186\" id=\"mwEiU\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEiY\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEic\">[</span>162<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEig\">]</span></span></a></sup> is running as a Libertarian. Former Democratic <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Idaho_House_of_Representatives\" title=\"Idaho House of Representatives\" id=\"mwEik\">state representative</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Todd_Achilles\" title=\"Todd Achilles\" id=\"mwEio\">Todd Achilles</a><sup about=\"#mwt3069\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-AchillesID2_187-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"AchillesID2\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-AchillesID2-187\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-AchillesID2-187\" id=\"mwEis\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEiw\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEi0\">[</span>163<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEi4\">]</span></span></a></sup> and software developer Natalie Fleming<sup about=\"#mwt3070\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-wr_182-2\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"wr\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-wr-182\" id=\"mwEi8\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEjA\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEjE\">[</span>158<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEjI\">]</span></span></a></sup> are running as <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Independent_politician\" title=\"Independent politician\" id=\"mwEjM\">independents</a>.</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt3071\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEjQ\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"29\" id=\"mwEjU\" aria-labelledby=\"Illinois\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Illinois\">Illinois</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=29\" title=\"Edit section: Illinois\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt3072\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEjY\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Infobox election\\n\",\"href\":\"./Template:Infobox_election\"},\"params\":{\"election_name\":{\"wt\":\"Illinois election\"},\"country\":{\"wt\":\"Illinois\"},\"type\":{\"wt\":\"presidential\"},\"ongoing\":{\"wt\":\"yes\"},\"previous_election\":{\"wt\":\"2020 United States Senate election in Illinois\"},\"previous_year\":{\"wt\":\"2020\"},\"next_election\":{\"wt\":\"2032 United States Senate election in Illinois\"},\"next_year\":{\"wt\":\"&apos;&apos;2032&apos;&apos;\"},\"image_size\":{\"wt\":\"125x136px\"},\"image1\":{\"wt\":\"File:Juliana Stratton 2023 (cropped).jpg\"},\"nominee1\":{\"wt\":\"[[Juliana Stratton]]\"},\"party1\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"wt\":\"3x4.svg\"},\"nominee2\":{\"wt\":\"[[Don Tracy]]\"},\"party2\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_image\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_size\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_caption\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"title\":{\"wt\":\"U.S. senator\"},\"before_election\":{\"wt\":\"[[Dick Durbin]]\"},\"before_party\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"after_election\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"after_party\":{\"wt\":\"\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" about=\"#mwt3073\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" about=\"#mwt3074\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Infobox election/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" about=\"#mwt3075\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Screen reader-only/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" about=\"#mwt3072\" id=\"mwEjc\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Illinois election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Illinois.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Flag_of_Illinois.svg/60px-Flag_of_Illinois.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Flag_of_Illinois.svg/120px-Flag_of_Illinois.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" alt=\"\" data-file-width=\"500\" data-file-height=\"300\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"30\" width=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></span></span></span><hr/></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">←</span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_United_States_Senate_election_in_Illinois\" title=\"2020 United States Senate election in Illinois\">2020</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><i>2032</i><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">→</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Juliana_Stratton_2023_(cropped).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Juliana_Stratton_2023_(cropped).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Juliana_Stratton_2023_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-Juliana_Stratton_2023_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Juliana_Stratton_2023_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Juliana_Stratton_2023_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1413\" data-file-height=\"1886\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"136\" width=\"102\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:3x4.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:3x4.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/3x4.svg/120px-3x4.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/3x4.svg/250px-3x4.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"3\" data-file-height=\"4\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"136\" width=\"102\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juliana_Stratton\" title=\"Juliana Stratton\">Juliana Stratton</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Don_Tracy\" title=\"Don Tracy\">Don Tracy</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Illinois\" title=\"List of United States senators from Illinois\">U.S. senator</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dick_Durbin\" title=\"Dick Durbin\">Dick Durbin</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt3076\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEjg\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 United States Senate election in Illinois\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt3077\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt3076\" id=\"mwEjk\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_Senate_election_in_Illinois\" title=\"2026 United States Senate election in Illinois\">2026 United States Senate election in Illinois</a></div>\n\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt3078\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEjo\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"See also\",\"href\":\"./Template:See_also\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"List of United States senators from Illinois\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt3079\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt3078\" id=\"mwEjs\">See also: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Illinois\" title=\"List of United States senators from Illinois\">List of United States senators from Illinois</a></div>\n<p id=\"mwEjw\">Five-term Democrat and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Senate_Democratic_Whip\" title=\"Senate Democratic Whip\" class=\"mw-redirect\" id=\"mwEj0\">Senate Democratic Whip</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dick_Durbin\" title=\"Dick Durbin\" id=\"mwEj4\">Dick Durbin</a> was <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_United_States_Senate_election_in_Illinois\" title=\"2020 United States Senate election in Illinois\" id=\"mwEj8\">reelected in 2020</a> with 54.9% of the vote. On April 23, 2025, he announced he would not run for reelection.<sup about=\"#mwt3080\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Durbin_29-2\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Durbin\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Durbin-29\" id=\"mwEkA\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEkE\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEkI\">[</span>17<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEkM\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<p id=\"mwEkQ\">On March 17, 2026, incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lieutenant_Governor_of_Illinois\" title=\"Lieutenant Governor of Illinois\" id=\"mwEkU\">Lieutenant Governor</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juliana_Stratton\" title=\"Juliana Stratton\" id=\"mwEkY\">Juliana Stratton</a> won the Democratic primary, defeating a crowded field, including <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_House_of_Representatives\" title=\"United States House of Representatives\" id=\"mwEkc\">U.S. Representatives</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raja_Krishnamoorthi\" title=\"Raja Krishnamoorthi\" id=\"mwEkg\">Raja Krishnamoorthi</a> and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robin_Kelly\" title=\"Robin Kelly\" id=\"mwEkk\">Robin Kelly</a>.<sup about=\"#mwt3083\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-lr_188-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"lr\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-lr-188\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-lr-188\" id=\"mwEko\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEks\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEkw\">[</span>164<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEk0\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<p id=\"mwEk4\">Former <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Illinois_Republican_Party\" title=\"Illinois Republican Party\" id=\"mwEk8\">Illinois Republican Party</a> Chairman <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Don_Tracy\" title=\"Don Tracy\" id=\"mwElA\">Don Tracy</a> easily won the Republican primary the same day, defeating attorney Jeannie Evans and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Polish_American_Congress\" title=\"Polish American Congress\" id=\"mwElE\">Polish American Congress</a> PAC national director Casey Chlebek.<sup about=\"#mwt3084\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-lr_188-1\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"lr\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-lr-188\" id=\"mwElI\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwElM\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwElQ\">[</span>164<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwElU\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt3085\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwElY\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"30\" id=\"mwElc\" aria-labelledby=\"Iowa\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Iowa\">Iowa</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=30\" title=\"Edit section: Iowa\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt3086\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwElg\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Infobox election\\n\",\"href\":\"./Template:Infobox_election\"},\"params\":{\"election_name\":{\"wt\":\"Iowa election\"},\"country\":{\"wt\":\"Iowa\"},\"type\":{\"wt\":\"presidential\"},\"ongoing\":{\"wt\":\"yes\"},\"previous_election\":{\"wt\":\"2020 United States Senate election in Iowa\"},\"previous_year\":{\"wt\":\"2020\"},\"next_election\":{\"wt\":\"2032 United States Senate election in Iowa\"},\"next_year\":{\"wt\":\"&apos;&apos;2032&apos;&apos;\"},\"image1\":{\"wt\":\"Congresswoman Ashley Hinson Official portrait (cropped).jpg\"},\"image_size\":{\"wt\":\"125x136px\"},\"nominee1\":{\"wt\":\"[[Ashley Hinson]]\"},\"party1\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"wt\":\"Joshua Turek (cropped).jpg\"},\"nominee2\":{\"wt\":\"[[Josh Turek]]\"},\"party2\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_image\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_size\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_caption\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"title\":{\"wt\":\"U.S. senator\"},\"before_election\":{\"wt\":\"[[Joni Ernst]]\"},\"before_party\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"after_election\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"after_party\":{\"wt\":\"\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" about=\"#mwt3087\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" about=\"#mwt3088\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Infobox election/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" about=\"#mwt3089\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Screen reader-only/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" about=\"#mwt3086\" id=\"mwElk\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Iowa election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Iowa.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/aa/Flag_of_Iowa.svg/60px-Flag_of_Iowa.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/aa/Flag_of_Iowa.svg/120px-Flag_of_Iowa.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" alt=\"\" data-file-width=\"714\" data-file-height=\"477\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"33\" width=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></span></span></span><hr/></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">←</span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_United_States_Senate_election_in_Iowa\" title=\"2020 United States Senate election in Iowa\">2020</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><i>2032</i><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">→</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Congresswoman_Ashley_Hinson_Official_portrait_(cropped).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Congresswoman_Ashley_Hinson_Official_portrait_(cropped).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Congresswoman_Ashley_Hinson_Official_portrait_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-Congresswoman_Ashley_Hinson_Official_portrait_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Congresswoman_Ashley_Hinson_Official_portrait_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Congresswoman_Ashley_Hinson_Official_portrait_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"909\" data-file-height=\"1211\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"136\" width=\"102\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Joshua_Turek_(cropped).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Joshua_Turek_(cropped).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/Joshua_Turek_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-Joshua_Turek_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/Joshua_Turek_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Joshua_Turek_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1200\" data-file-height=\"1599\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"136\" width=\"102\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashley_Hinson\" title=\"Ashley Hinson\">Ashley Hinson</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Josh_Turek\" title=\"Josh Turek\">Josh Turek</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Iowa\" title=\"List of United States senators from Iowa\">U.S. senator</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joni_Ernst\" title=\"Joni Ernst\">Joni Ernst</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt3090\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwElo\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 United States Senate election in Iowa\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt3091\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt3090\" id=\"mwEls\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_Senate_election_in_Iowa\" title=\"2026 United States Senate election in Iowa\">2026 United States Senate election in Iowa</a></div>\n\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt3092\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwElw\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"See also\",\"href\":\"./Template:See_also\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"List of United States senators from Iowa\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt3093\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt3092\" id=\"mwEl0\">See also: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Iowa\" title=\"List of United States senators from Iowa\">List of United States senators from Iowa</a></div>\n<p id=\"mwEl4\">Two-term Republican <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joni_Ernst\" title=\"Joni Ernst\" id=\"mwEl8\">Joni Ernst</a> was <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_United_States_Senate_election_in_Iowa\" title=\"2020 United States Senate election in Iowa\" id=\"mwEmA\">reelected in 2020</a> with 51.7% of the vote.<sup about=\"#mwt3096\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-generalcanvass_189-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"generalcanvass\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-generalcanvass-189\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-generalcanvass-189\" id=\"mwEmE\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEmI\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEmM\">[</span>165<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEmQ\">]</span></span></a></sup> On September 2, 2025, she announced that she would not seek reelection to a third term, after being criticized for comments about reductions in Medicaid.<sup about=\"#mwt3099\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-190\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-190\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-190\" id=\"mwEmU\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEmY\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEmc\">[</span>166<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEmg\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<p id=\"mwEmk\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/U.S._Representative\" title=\"U.S. Representative\" class=\"mw-redirect\" id=\"mwEmo\">U.S. Representative</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashley_Hinson\" title=\"Ashley Hinson\" id=\"mwEms\">Ashley Hinson</a> easily defeated former <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iowa_Senate\" title=\"Iowa Senate\" id=\"mwEmw\">state Senator</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jim_Carlin_(politician)\" title=\"Jim Carlin (politician)\" id=\"mwEm0\">Jim Carlin</a> in the June 2, 2026, Republican primary to succeed Ernst.<sup about=\"#mwt3102\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-191\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-191\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-191\" id=\"mwEm4\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEm8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEnA\">[</span>167<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEnE\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<p id=\"mwEnI\">In the Democratic primary, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iowa_House_of_Representatives\" title=\"Iowa House of Representatives\" id=\"mwEnM\">state Representative</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Josh_Turek\" title=\"Josh Turek\" id=\"mwEnQ\">Josh Turek</a> defeated <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iowa_Senate\" title=\"Iowa Senate\" id=\"mwEnU\">state Senator</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zach_Wahls\" title=\"Zach Wahls\" id=\"mwEnY\">Zach Wahls</a> by a comfortable margin.<sup about=\"#mwt3104\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-192\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-192\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-192\" id=\"mwEnc\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEng\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEnk\">[</span>168<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEno\">]</span></span></a></sup> Both candidates had cited Ernst's remarks about Medicare as a factor in their decisions to run.<link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:All_articles_with_unsourced_statements\" about=\"#mwt3103\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEns\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"citation needed\",\"href\":\"./Template:Citation_needed\"},\"params\":{\"date\":{\"wt\":\"June 2026\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'/><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:Articles_with_unsourced_statements_from_June_2026\" about=\"#mwt3103\"/><sup class=\"noprint Inline-Template Template-Fact\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\" about=\"#mwt3103\" id=\"mwEnw\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">[</span><i><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Citation_needed\" title=\"Wikipedia:Citation needed\"><span title=\"This claim needs references to reliable sources. (June 2026)\">citation needed</span></a></i><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">]</span></sup></p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt3105\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEn0\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"31\" id=\"mwEn4\" aria-labelledby=\"Kansas\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Kansas\">Kansas</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=31\" title=\"Edit section: Kansas\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt3106\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEn8\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Infobox election\\n\",\"href\":\"./Template:Infobox_election\"},\"params\":{\"election_name\":{\"wt\":\"Kansas election\"},\"country\":{\"wt\":\"Kansas\"},\"type\":{\"wt\":\"presidential\"},\"ongoing\":{\"wt\":\"yes\"},\"previous_election\":{\"wt\":\"2020 United States Senate election in Kansas\"},\"previous_year\":{\"wt\":\"2020\"},\"next_election\":{\"wt\":\"2032 United States Senate election in Kansas\"},\"next_year\":{\"wt\":\"&apos;&apos;2032&apos;&apos;\"},\"election_date\":{\"wt\":\"&lt;!--Don&apos;t need election date in section infoboxes when the date is the same as in the article&apos;s main infobox.-->\"},\"image_size\":{\"wt\":\"125x136px\"},\"turnout\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image1\":{\"wt\":\"Roger Marshall 117th Congress portrait (cropped center).jpg\"},\"nominee1\":{\"wt\":\"[[Roger Marshall]]\"},\"party1\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"wt\":\"Adam Hamilton at podium (cropped 2).jpg\"},\"nominee2\":{\"wt\":\"[[Adam Hamilton (pastor)|Adam Hamilton]]\"},\"party2\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image3\":{\"wt\":\"3x4.svg\"},\"nominee3\":{\"wt\":\"David Graham\"},\"party3\":{\"wt\":\"Libertarian Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote3\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage3\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_image\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_size\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_caption\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"title\":{\"wt\":\"U.S. Senator\"},\"before_election\":{\"wt\":\"[[Roger Marshall]]\"},\"before_party\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"after_election\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"after_party\":{\"wt\":\"\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" about=\"#mwt3107\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" about=\"#mwt3108\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Infobox election/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" about=\"#mwt3109\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Screen reader-only/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" about=\"#mwt3106\" id=\"mwEoA\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Kansas election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Kansas.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Flag_of_Kansas.svg/60px-Flag_of_Kansas.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Flag_of_Kansas.svg/120px-Flag_of_Kansas.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" alt=\"\" data-file-width=\"500\" data-file-height=\"300\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"30\" width=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></span></span></span><hr/></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">←</span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_United_States_Senate_election_in_Kansas\" title=\"2020 United States Senate election in Kansas\">2020</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><i>2032</i><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">→</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: i