style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Senator_Mark_Warner_Portrait_(cut_cropped).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Senator_Mark_Warner_Portrait_(cut_cropped).png\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9f/Senator_Mark_Warner_Portrait_%28cut_cropped%29.png/120px-Senator_Mark_Warner_Portrait_%28cut_cropped%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9f/Senator_Mark_Warner_Portrait_%28cut_cropped%29.png/250px-Senator_Mark_Warner_Portrait_%28cut_cropped%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"3037\" data-file-height=\"4050\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"136\" width=\"102\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:110311160930_MG_Mizusawa,_Bert_(cropped).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:110311160930_MG_Mizusawa,_Bert_(cropped).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/63/110311160930_MG_Mizusawa%2C_Bert_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-110311160930_MG_Mizusawa%2C_Bert_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/63/110311160930_MG_Mizusawa%2C_Bert_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-110311160930_MG_Mizusawa%2C_Bert_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1229\" data-file-height=\"1639\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"136\" width=\"102\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Warner\" title=\"Mark Warner\">Mark Warner</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bert_Mizusawa\" title=\"Bert Mizusawa\">Bert Mizusawa</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Virginia\" title=\"List of United States senators from Virginia\">U.S. senator</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Warner\" title=\"Mark Warner\">Mark Warner</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt3741\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwFqc\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 United States Senate election in Virginia\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt3742\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt3741\" id=\"mwFqg\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_Senate_election_in_Virginia\" title=\"2026 United States Senate election in Virginia\">2026 United States Senate election in Virginia</a></div>\n\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt3743\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwFqk\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"See also\",\"href\":\"./Template:See_also\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"List of United States senators from Virginia\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt3744\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt3743\" id=\"mwFqo\">See also: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Virginia\" title=\"List of United States senators from Virginia\">List of United States senators from Virginia</a></div>\n<p id=\"mwFqs\">Three-term Democrat <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Warner\" title=\"Mark Warner\" id=\"mwFqw\">Mark Warner</a> was reelected in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_United_States_Senate_election_in_Virginia\" title=\"2020 United States Senate election in Virginia\" id=\"mwFq0\">2020</a> with 56% of the vote and is running for reelection. As the only person to submit the necessary number of signatures to appear on the primary ballot, Warner is the Democratic nominee.<sup about=\"#mwt3747\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-WarnerVA_148-1\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"WarnerVA\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-WarnerVA-148\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-WarnerVA-148\" id=\"mwFq4\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwFq8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFrA\">[</span>124<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFrE\">]</span></span></a></sup></p><p id=\"mwFrI\">\n\nRetired <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_Army\" title=\"United States Army\" id=\"mwFrM\">United States Army</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Major_general\" title=\"Major general\" id=\"mwFrQ\">Major General</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bert_Mizusawa\" title=\"Bert Mizusawa\" id=\"mwFrU\">Bert Mizusawa</a>, who previously ran for U.S. Senate in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2018_United_States_Senate_election_in_Virginia\" title=\"2018 United States Senate election in Virginia\" id=\"mwFrY\">2018</a> and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Virginia's_2nd_congressional_district\" title=\"Virginia's 2nd congressional district\" id=\"mwFrc\">Virginia's 2nd congressional district</a> in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2010_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Virginia#District_3\" title=\"2010 United States House of Representatives elections in Virginia\" id=\"mwFrg\">2010</a>,<sup about=\"#mwt3751\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-320\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-320\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-320\" id=\"mwFrk\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwFro\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFrs\">[</span>296<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFrw\">]</span></span></a></sup> won the Republican nomination over <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Certified_Public_Accountant\" title=\"Certified Public Accountant\" id=\"mwFr0\">Certified Public Accountant</a> Kim Farrington<sup about=\"#mwt3754\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FarringtonVA_321-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"FarringtonVA\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FarringtonVA-321\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-FarringtonVA-321\" id=\"mwFr4\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwFr8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFsA\">[</span>297<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFsE\">]</span></span></a></sup> and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_Marine_Corps_Reserve\" title=\"United States Marine Corps Reserve\" id=\"mwFsI\">U.S. Marine Corps Reserve</a> Colonel David Williams.<sup about=\"#mwt3757\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-322\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-322\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-322\" id=\"mwFsM\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwFsQ\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFsU\">[</span>298<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFsY\">]</span></span></a></sup></p><div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt3748\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwFsc\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"54\" id=\"mwFsg\" aria-labelledby=\"West_Virginia\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"West_Virginia\">West Virginia</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</spa