 title=\"2020 United States Senate election in West Virginia\">2020</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><i>2032</i><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">→</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Shelley_Moore_Capito_official_Senate_photo_(cropped_2).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Shelley_Moore_Capito_official_Senate_photo_(cropped_2).jpg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Shelley_Moore_Capito_official_Senate_photo_%28cropped_2%29.jpg/120px-Shelley_Moore_Capito_official_Senate_photo_%28cropped_2%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Shelley_Moore_Capito_official_Senate_photo_%28cropped_2%29.jpg/250px-Shelley_Moore_Capito_official_Senate_photo_%28cropped_2%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1625\" data-file-height=\"2189\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"136\" width=\"101\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:3x4.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:3x4.svg\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/3x4.svg/120px-3x4.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/3x4.svg/250px-3x4.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"3\" data-file-height=\"4\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"136\" width=\"102\" class=\"mw-file-element\"/></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shelley_Moore_Capito\" title=\"Shelley Moore Capito\">Shelley Moore Capito</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Rachel Fetty Anderson</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr/>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b>Incumbent <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_West_Virginia\" title=\"List of United States senators from West Virginia\">U.S. senator</a></b><br/>\n<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shelley_Moore_Capito\" title=\"Shelley Moore Capito\">Shelley Moore Capito</a><br/>\n<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></p></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><br/>\n<p>\n<br/></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt3762\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwFss\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"2026 United States Senate election in West Virginia\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt3763\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt3762\" id=\"mwFsw\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_Senate_election_in_West_Virginia\" title=\"2026 United States Senate election in West Virginia\">2026 United States Senate election in West Virginia</a></div>\n\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt3764\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwFs0\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"See also\",\"href\":\"./Template:See_also\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"List of United States senators from West Virginia\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt3765\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt3764\" id=\"mwFs4\">See also: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_West_Virginia\" title=\"List of United States senators from West Virginia\">List of United States senators from West Virginia</a></div>\n<p id=\"mwFs8\">Two-term Republican <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shelley_Moore_Capito\" title=\"Shelley Moore Capito\" id=\"mwFtA\">Shelley Moore Capito</a> was <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_United_States_Senate_election_in_West_Virginia\" title=\"2020 United States Senate election in West Virginia\" id=\"mwFtE\">reelected in 2020</a> with 70.3% of the vote and is running for reelection to a third term.<sup about=\"#mwt3768\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-323\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-323\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-323\" id=\"mwFtI\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwFtM\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFtQ\">[</span>299<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFtU\">]</span></span></a></sup> She won the Republican primary on May 12.<sup about=\"#mwt3771\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-324\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-324\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-324\" id=\"mwFtY\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwFtc\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFtg\">[</span>300<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFtk\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<p id=\"mwFto\">Former <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Morgantown,_West_Virginia\" title=\"Morgantown, West Virginia\" id=\"mwFts\">Morgantown</a> City Councilwoman Rachel Fetty Anderson<sup about=\"#mwt3774\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-WV_325-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"WV\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-WV-325\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-WV-325\" id=\"mwFtw\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwFt0\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFt4\">[</span>301<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFt8\">]</span></span></a></sup> won the Democratic primary on May 12, 2026.<sup about=\"#mwt3777\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-326\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-326\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-326\" id=\"mwFuA\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwFuE\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFuI\">[</span>302<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFuM\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\" about=\"#mwt3778\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwFuQ\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"clear\",\"href\":\"./Template:Clear\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"55\" id=\"mwFuU\" aria-labelledby=\"Wyoming\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Wyoming\">Wyoming</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=55\" title=\"Edit section: Wyoming\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt3779\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwFuY\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Infobox election\\n\",\"href\":\"./Template:Infobox_election\"},\"params\":{\"election_name\":{\"wt\":\"Wyoming election\"},\"country\":{\"wt\":\"Wyoming\"},\"type\":{\"wt\":\"presidential\"},\"ongoing\":{\"wt\":\"yes\"},\"previous_election\":{\"wt\":\"2020 United States Senate election in Wyoming\"},\"previous_year\":{\"wt\":\"2020\"},\"next_election\":{\"wt\":\"2032 United States Senate election in Wyoming\"},\"next_year\":{\"wt\":\"&apos;&apos;2032&apos;&apos;\"},\"election_date\":{\"wt\":\"&lt;!--Don&apos;t need election date in section infoboxes when the date is the same as in the article&apos;s main infobox.-->\"},\"image_size\":{\"wt\":\"125x136px\"},\"turnout\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image1\":{\"wt\":\"File:Official-harriet-hageman-wy00 (cropped).jpg\"},\"nominee1\":{\"wt\":\"[[Harriet Hageman]]\"},\"party1\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage1\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"wt\":\"James W. Byrd at Campbell County League of Women Voters&apos; General Election Candidates&apos; Forum in Gillette, Wyoming (cropped).jpg\"},\"nominee2\":{\"wt\":\"[[James W. Byrd]]\"},\"party2\":{\"wt\":\"Democratic Party (United States)\"},\"popular_vote2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"percentage2\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_image\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_size\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"map_caption\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"title\":{\"wt\":\"U.S. Senator\"},\"before_election\":{\"wt\":\"[[Cynthia Lummis]]\"},\"before_party\":{\"wt\":\"Republican Party (United States)\"},\"after_election\":{\"wt\":\"\"},\"after_party\":{\"wt\":\"\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" about=\"#mwt3780\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" about=\"#mwt3781\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Infobox election/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" about=\"#mwt3782\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Screen reader-only/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" about=\"#mwt3779\" id=\"mwFuc\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Wyoming election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img resource=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Wyoming.svg\" src=\"//thum