1\" data-mw-footnote-number=\"13\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\" id=\"mwGBI\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-21\" rel=\"mw:referencedBy\" id=\"mwGBM\"><span class=\"mw-linkback-text\" id=\"mwGBQ\">↑</span></a></span> <span id=\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-21\" class=\"mw-reference-text reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" about=\"#mwt74\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwGBU\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"},\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"cite news \",\"href\":\"./Template:Cite_news\"},\"params\":{\"title\":{\"wt\":\"Battered by gas prices at the polls, GOP faces key Iran war vote\"},\"url\":{\"wt\":\"https://www.politico.com/news/2026/09/24/senate-iran-war-powers-fuel-prices-01091163\"},\"access-date\":{\"wt\":\"September 24, 2026\"},\"publisher\":{\"wt\":\"Politico\"},\"date\":{\"wt\":\"September 24, 2026\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'/><cite class=\"citation news cs1\" about=\"#mwt74\" id=\"mwGBY\"><a rel=\"mw:ExtLink nofollow\" href=\"https://www.politico.com/news/2026/09/24/senate-iran-war-powers-fuel-prices-01091163\" class=\"external text\" id=\"mwGBc\">\"Battered by gas prices at the polls, GOP faces key Iran war vote\"</a>. Politico. September 24, 2026<span class=\"reference-accessdate\" id=\"mwGBg\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\" id=\"mwGBk\">September 24,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=Battered+by+gas+prices+at+the+polls%2C+GOP+faces+key+Iran+war+vote&amp;rft.date=2026-09-24&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.politico.com%2Fnews%2F2026%2F09%2F24%2Fsenate-iran-war-powers-fuel-prices-01091163&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\" about=\"#mwt74\" id=\"mwGBo\"></span></span></li>\n<li about=\"#cite_note-OK_Statutes-25\" id=\"cite_note-OK_Statutes-25\" data-mw-footnote-number=\"14\"><span rel=\"mw:referencedBy\" class=\"mw-cite-backlink\" id=\"mwGBs\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-OK_Statutes_25-0\" id=\"mwGBw\"><span class=\"mw-linkback-text\" id=\"mwGB0\">1</span></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-OK_Statutes_25-1\" id=\"mwGB4\"><span class=\"mw-linkback-text\" id=\"mwGB8\">2</span></a></span> <span id=\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-OK_Statutes-25\" class=\"mw-reference-text reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" about=\"#mwt406\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" id=\"mwGCA\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/><cite class=\"citation web cs1\" id=\"mwGCE\"><a rel=\"mw:ExtLink nofollow\" href=\"https://law.justia.com/codes/oklahoma/title-51/section-51-10/\" class=\"external text\" id=\"mwGCI\">\"2025 Oklahoma Statutes Title 51. Officers §51-10. Vacancies - Appointments - Special elections\"</a>. Justia US Law<span class=\"reference-accessdate\" id=\"mwGCM\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\" id=\"mwGCQ\">March 25,</span> 2026</span>. <q id=\"mwGCU\">Prior to an appointment pursuant to paragraph 1 of subsection C of this section, a person who is a prospective appointee shall submit to the Secretary of State an oath affirming that the person will not file as a candidate for the office when it next appears on the ballot. The Secretary of State shall prescribe the oath required by this paragraph, and any oath submitted shall be public record and published on the website of the Office of the Secretary of State.</q></cite><span title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=2025+Oklahoma+Statutes+Title+51.+Officers+%C2%A751-10.+Vacancies+-+Appointments+-+Special+elections.&amp;rft.pub=Justia+US+Law&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Flaw.justia.com%2Fcodes%2Foklahoma%2Ftitle-51%2Fsec